//   Retrieved  : 2026-10-07. The code below this block is the author's published source, verified
//                line by line against the TradingView page (whitespace and blank lines aside).
//   Use in this project: ported (re-implemented) in `Combined Role-Based Strategy.pine` and
//                `backtest/engine/`; this file itself is not modified or executed by the study.
